  "name": "RegretClusterNN",
  "intent": "Intended behavior change: add a small positive weight on regret to prioritize candidates with high regret (second-nearest minus nearest) and a small positive weight on cluster_density to favor nodes in dense unvisited regions, thereby shifting selection away from pure nearest neighbor in a controlled manner.",
